# App Audit

> Skill: `.cursor/skills/app-audit-development/SKILL.md`

## Stack

NestJS 11, Clean Architecture, Swagger, GitHub CLI, GitHub Advisories API, OpenSourceMalware API.

## Camadas

- `domain/` — sem dependências externas
- `application/` — use cases
- `infrastructure/` — adapters (gh, OSM, GitHub Advisories)
- `presentation/` — controllers + DTOs

## Ao modificar

1. Atualizar Swagger e DTOs
2. Manter threat intel sincronizado (`ThreatIntelModule`)
3. Regenerar relatório: `npm run audit:miasma`

